{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4d28af4808754bc0bc4a7c0fb89922d02f281d50dcc480246f4eddcc70ad4cbe", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまで……。", "zh": "青羽小姐，您辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9836e02acf0352f64d83b268f791de0bb1deae913046c91b066cda15010e837", "ja": "いたいたっ、{$P$}さん！\n社長さんがお呼びですよ！", "zh": "找到了找到了，{$P$}先生！\n社长叫您呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a31ef73d586a84ccf751d488ffe10340d624969a60bb1cb47c09005786e0e03a", "ja": "っとと、そんな食い気味に……凄いテンションですね！\n何かいい話なんですか？", "zh": "哎呀，您这么急着接话……情绪真高涨啊！是有什么好消息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "854d3c9e0ed1967645e44412ef1f9c8ea31763a36915c1ee5bd4d918501dbcb9", "ja": "あ、いえ……えへへ♪\n私も、詳しい話は聞いていないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，不是……嘿嘿♪\n我其实也没听到详细情况……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8a5b104ac1f08a414c1ed24daaa91f83b4b11c3b79a5039574c5ce085db405f", "ja": "でも、時期的に、アレの話なんじゃないかな～って！\nほら、アレですよアレ！", "zh": "不过，按时间来看，我觉得应该是那件事吧～！\n就是那个呀，那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6817fbc7a73467ff5d662e8d3bef938181ad9a620aaa410a2fbdea2498572bd5", "ja": "アレ……ああ！　なるほど、アレですね。\nそれじゃあ、気を引き締めて……行ってきます！", "zh": "那个……啊！原来如此，是那个啊。\n那么，我会打起精神……出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "bcb5bcdc6ad3ae360ada0c6e790dc2b7c158c902493cacd2b924ac344caa4b24", "ja": "はい！　お気をつけて、\n行ってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好的！路上小心，慢走——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d6345663e0b3d2d651b205daef3f1c0113127c050d6656878a924b10a470101", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！\nなんでも、お話があるとか……アレについての。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了！\n听说有什么事要谈……是关于那件事的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "0c6a64fab79c7619d1b46f68d60824325f4d222951db437d6f02caabc5957bb3", "ja": "ああ、君！　よく来てくれたね。\nそうなんだよ、今日はお待ちかねの、アレの話だ。", "zh": "啊，是你！欢迎你来。\n没错，今天要说的就是大家期待已久的那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "46d2542474bd5095d4a3c4f8c42307a584db495452d4dde844cda65d3611c34e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nうふふ、みんなが楽しみにしているアレですね！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n呵呵，就是大家都很期待的那个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "3a71b3b5e2c564e4866c713d12bb65c62b9cc185cedd8274009556e64756408d", "ja": "うむ！　では早速、アレ……我が社の\n新しい名刺のデザインについて、語り合うとしよう！", "zh": "嗯！那么马上就来谈谈那个吧……关于我们公司的新名片设计！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "386be7d079d18583e2e0b04a1013f0f268f9f5c224fd8713e1d920fa5fa9fdfd", "ja": "あれっ！？\nてっきりツアー公演の話かと……。", "zh": "咦！？\n我还以为是谈巡回公演的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "323167c69ab6dd5d609544c94f5bf7f358a06cfa046fc5578eb602fe46ae03c6", "ja": "はっはっは！　すまんすまん、今のはジョークだよ。\nちょっとわかりづらかったかな？", "zh": "哈哈哈！抱歉抱歉，刚才是在开玩笑。\n是不是有点难懂？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "0a6b3ac47754d7bec87a23a7f691b9990472ddde14cd94189cda7ebd789ba28a", "ja": "君の予想どおり、今日の議題はツアー公演……\n『EmotionLight』公演についてだ。", "zh": "如你所料，今天的议题是巡回演出……\n关于“EmotionLight”演出一事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "a544f9f95eddeef468bcb77832325382164396a8733a3395eefd45fbbbe918bc", "ja": "もう、社長ったら！　{$P$}さんを\nからかったらいけないんですよ。", "zh": "真是的，社长！您可不能\n捉弄{$P$}先生呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ed7a3b5ef7705746c7feb5d8a12c79228f75a093014d299803c3e68f8330875a", "ja": "ああ、よかった……。", "zh": "啊，太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "7c47de24566baad76d50d870d069ef954dc70df053b33f87bfe63141ad2d6498", "ja": "黄昏の時を想う夕の祝祭『EmotionLight』\n公演……今回は、ハートとスペードの混合チームだ。", "zh": "追忆黄昏时光的晚间庆典《EmotionLight》公演……这次是红心与黑桃的混合队伍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "cee3854483ff0506344b9be1d77ca64ddfa6b796c7694987160fb663646bdfdb", "ja": "テーマは夕方。朝、昼と、アイドル諸君が\n高めてくれた熱を受けて……。", "zh": "主题是傍晚。承接偶像们从早晨到白天不断升温的热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "d54ec9d2fec2a54b617d74000351245297c4ead81ad18ad19b6809d7a8fff1bd", "ja": "様々な色が溶け合い、変化していく夕焼け空のように、\n夜公演へと繋いでいってもらいたい！", "zh": "希望如各种色彩交融变幻的晚霞天空一般，将演出延续到晚场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3d1763dde563b287ef3bb61526ff161352161ced26ef29cac75e6debaa084163", "ja": "はい！　これまでと同じように、\nアイドルのみんなと一緒に、成功させてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我会和偶像们一起，像之前一样让它成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "d784ba4fc59cb5f0303fb68fbc7613ea32e204cb17cf35915c596514a790938d", "ja": "うんうん、いや、実に頼もしい！\nよろしく頼んだよ。", "zh": "嗯嗯，不，真是可靠！\n拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "8c745208ca5c8240988632816c8461e1fa1e7ed1f180e1b0f139b7f940153573", "ja": "ファイナルシーズンも、そして、その先の武道館も……\nうふふ、楽しみがたくさんですね♪", "zh": "最终季，还有之后的武道馆……\n呜呼呼，真是有好多值得期待的事情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "a5ca2633a093b950a62ac6c29f9671577a0a1be1c261aedbd9de5375ff663ac7", "ja": "私も、できる限りのお手伝いをしますから！\n一緒に頑張らせてくださいね。", "zh": "我也会尽我所能帮忙的！请让我和大家一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3aa49363a131d7dba5c5bd1d574d188bf0fe0e6505799ab377fdc3019d328cf7", "ja": "音無さん……はい、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "音无小姐……好的，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0267_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1490d70e45f8204023215ff79a74b426c93c8ee2afe1a1c239f1191f6b9dae28", "ja": "（アイドルのみんなや、765プロの職員……\nみんなで一丸となって、大成功を目指していこう！）", "zh": "（偶像们和765事务所的工作人员……大家齐心协力，一起争取取得圆满成功吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
